There had previously been four English-Spanish encounters in the UEFA Super Cup ([[1979 European Super Cup|1979]], [[1980 European Super Cup|1980]], [[1982 European Super Cup|1982]], [[1998 UEFA Super Cup|1998]]), with English teams winning three out of four.<ref>{{cite web |title=Chelsea and Atlético latest in a long line |url=https://www.uefa.com/uefasupercup/news/0250-0c50fb285e2c-44fcc5703731-1000--chelsea-and-atletico-latest-in-a-long-line/ |work=[[UEFA]] |publisher=Union of European Football Associations |date=9 July 2012 |access-date=31 August 2012 }}</ref>

